   {
    "en": "The Obsessed Neighbor and I, the Exiled One"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Our heroine was born into a legendary family blessed with the rare ability to control the weather through song—but she was the sole exception, born without this gift, making her an outcast within her own family.\n\nFor years, she was constantly compared to her talented cousin, until the humiliation reached its peak—her fiancé was taken from her, and she was forced to leave the capital.\n\nWith only a small amount of money and a few belongings, she set out to start anew on the outskirts of the kingdom, where no one knew her name. But there, she encounters a handsome yet mysterious neighbor, one who seems far too interested in her…\n\nWhy does he keep following her? And why does it feel like he’s hiding a secret?\n\nA heartwarming romance between an exiled noblewoman and a mysterious man who holds a love deeper than she ever imagined!"
  },
